  "faq": [
    {
      "q": "Old ya New tax regime? Kaunsa better hai?",
      "a": "Yeh apki deductions (like 80C, HRA, home loan interest) pe depend karta hai. Agar deductions 3.75 Lakh se zyada hain, toh usually Old regime better hota hai. Hum dono evaluate karke best option suggest karte hain."
    },
    {
      "q": "Freelancers ko kaunsa form bharna chahiye?",
      "a": "Freelancers aur professionals (like IT consultants, doctors) ke liye ITR-4 (Section 44ADA) best rehta hai. Isme aap 50% income ko expense claim kar sakte ho."
    },
    {
      "q": "Kya GST registration lene ke baad return file karna zaroori hai agar sale zero ho?",
      "a": "Haan! Agar aapne GST number liya hai, toh 'Nil Return' file karna mandatory hai. Late filing pe ₹20-50 per day ki penalty lag sakti hai."
    },
    {
      "q": "Notice aane par kya karein?",
      "a": "Ghabrayein nahi. Notice WhatsApp par share karein. Hum check karenge ki notice defective return ka hai ya scrutiny ka, aur accordingly reply file karenge."
    }
  ],
